hat are instances of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". The constituent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shapes can be a mixture of different kinds of shapes.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapecollection","title":"MLNShapeCollection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolygon":{"title":"MLNMultiPolygon","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMultiPolygon"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon"},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a shape consisting of one or more"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"polygons that do not overlap. For example, you could use a multipolygon shape","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to represent the body of land that consists of an island surrounded by an"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"atoll: the inner island would be one ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object, while the surrounding"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"atoll would be another. You could also use a multipolygon shape to represent a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"group of disconnected but related buildings.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNSymbolStyleLayer":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolstylelayer","type":"topic","title":"MLNSymbolStyleLayer","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyl